// Story - Tines

Create detections in LimaCharlie Detect HackTool > Slack & Email

Slack & Email will contain:

- Title
- Time 
- Computer Name
- Source IP
- Process
- Command Line
- File Path
- Sensor ID 
- Link to the detection (If applicable)

Tines > Prompt user to take action to the machine (Isolate/Don't Isolate)

- If Yes: LimaCharlie should automatically isolate the machine and message should be sent to Slack & Email
  - Message: Isolate status with note of "The computer <Computer> has been isolated"

- If No: LimaCharlie will not isolate the machine
 - Message: Isolation status with note "The computer <Computer> was not isolated, please investigare"